== Introduction to Optimization for Engineers -- ELEC 400O | MECH 410Q | MECH 540G
Winter Term, 2026--27. Instructors: [https://www.albertopadoan.com/ Alberto Padoan] and [https://mech.ubc.ca/dominic-liao-mcpherson/ Dominic Liao-McPherson]. \n
Links: [https://www.albertopadoan.com/opt.html Website] | [https://piazza.com/class/mte4yit32nf6rr Piazza] | [https://canvas.ubc.ca/courses/202936 Canvas 400O], [https://canvas.ubc.ca/courses/202961 Canvas 41OQ], [https://canvas.ubc.ca/courses/202961 Canvas 540G].

